      "comment": "S11 · Who holds the key · Option A. Contains “ · ”: usually separate strings (title · subtitle, sheet rows). Split into their own keys when building the view, unless the UI shows a literal middle dot.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bedrock keeps it · You type a code you never see whole. It’s released only after the steps. · Works tonight, on your own"
