    "onb.s12.cta": {
      "comment": "S12 · Remove the door · CTA. Contains “ · ”: usually separate strings (title · subtitle, sheet rows). Split into their own keys when building the view, unless the UI shows a literal middle dot. Prices are examples: build this with StoreKit’s localized price, never the literal.",
